{"appid": 1227280, "gama": {"steamId": 1227280, "id": 1227280, "name": "Despot's Game: Dystopian Battle Simulator", "copiesSold": 328329, "unreleased": false, "earlyAccess": false, "firstReleaseDate": 1634184000000, "releaseDate": 1664424000000, "earlyAccessExitDate": 1664424000000, "EAReleaseDate": 1634184000000, "price": 19.99, "developers": ["Konfa Games"], "publishers": ["tinyBuild"], "publisherClass": "AA", "reviewScore": 84, "genres": ["Indie", "RPG", "Strategy"], "tags": ["Auto Battler", "Pixel Graphics", "Roguelike", "Tactical", "Indie", "Turn-Based Tactics", "RPG", "2D", "Dark Humor", "Roguelite", "Singleplayer", "Strategy", "Adventure", "Survival", "Asynchronous Multiplayer", "Atmospheric", "Dungeon Crawler", "Procedural Generation", "Replay Value", "Turn-Based"]}, "store": {"type": "game", "name": "Despot's Game 暴君的游戏", "steam_appid": 1227280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [1785070, 2089800], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >准备受死吧，人类！</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一群小人在奇异的后末世迷宫中醒来——赤身裸体，没有记忆，身旁还有一堆武器。这是一场玩笑，一次疯狂实验，还是……一局游戏？你很快就会知道的，别先死了就行！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227280/extras/000fd00a5c6ae0fae06de42b5aacae78.poster.avif?t=1781522438\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227280/extras/000fd00a5c6ae0fae06de42b5aacae78.webm?t=1781522438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227280/extras/000fd00a5c6ae0fae06de42b5aacae78.mp4?t=1781522438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >准备好你的椒盐饼干</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你的小小队伍蕴含着大大能量。选择你的战利品，让这些软萌的小人化身巫师、异教徒、忍者以及包含神话中的椒盐饼干投掷者在内的众多英雄。特殊技能和职业组合千变万化，你有成千上万种方法来组建自己的军队。食人卷心菜会对其饮食的多样性大加赞赏！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227280/extras/f22e7b3f802f8cde36187df3803c8a97.poster.avif?t=1781522438\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227280/extras/f22e7b3f802f8cde36187df3803c8a97.webm?t=1781522438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227280/extras/f22e7b3f802f8cde36187df3803c8a97.mp4?t=1781522438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >击垮劲敌</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >如果你能在迷宫中生存下来，你将会遇到其他玩家势不可挡的终极组合！你们将展开殊死搏斗，唯有一人能得暴君饶恕。无意冒犯，但在暴君的游戏里，暴君自己说了算！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227280/extras/1c146f6f3dde54df55b6f29dbad563b9.poster.avif?t=1781522438\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227280/extras/1c146f6f3dde54df55b6f29dbad563b9.webm?t=1781522438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227280/extras/1c146f6f3dde54df55b6f29dbad563b9.mp4?t=1781522438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >间接战斗</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >为你的战士们做好准备，让他们自己投入战斗！间接战斗让你能够专注于运筹帷幄而非即时反应。用冰箱搬运工加强你的前线，拿食物投掷器进行瞄准，照顾好你的禁术召唤师！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227280/extras/e3c0cf4fe971ad78b5b35774e98b2789.poster.avif?t=1781522438\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227280/extras/e3c0cf4fe971ad78b5b35774e98b2789.webm?t=1781522438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227280/extras/e3c0cf4fe971ad78b5b35774e98b2789.mp4?t=1781522438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >无尽探索</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你在地下城里每次都要白手起家，弱小的人类永远不会找到出路！而且，即便走了运也不必担心——在《暴君的游戏》里，死法的花样多了去呢！</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >准备受死吧，人类！</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一群小人在奇异的后末世迷宫中醒来——赤身裸体，没有记忆，身旁还有一堆武器。这是一场玩笑，一次疯狂实验，还是……一局游戏？你很快就会知道的，别先死了就行！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227280/extras/000fd00a5c6ae0fae06de42b5aacae78.poster.avif?t=1781522438\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227280/extras/000fd00a5c6ae0fae06de42b5aacae78.webm?t=1781522438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227280/extras/000fd00a5c6ae0fae06de42b5aacae78.mp4?t=1781522438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >准备好你的椒盐饼干</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你的小小队伍蕴含着大大能量。选择你的战利品，让这些软萌的小人化身巫师、异教徒、忍者以及包含神话中的椒盐饼干投掷者在内的众多英雄。特殊技能和职业组合千变万化，你有成千上万种方法来组建自己的军队。食人卷心菜会对其饮食的多样性大加赞赏！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1227280/extras/f22e7b3f802f8cde36187df3803c8a97.poster.a